SDP.Item.Skill.healing.Description:
The Care Skill represents your ability to treat wounds, combat illness, and stabilize people or animals in danger. Possessing this Skill allows you to keep animals in good health under normal conditions without needing to make a Test.

A successful Care Test notably allows you to:
Diagnose a wound, infection, or disease;
Treat a disease or limit its effects;
Restore a number of Wounds equal to your Intelligence Bonus + SL (a character may benefit from only one Care Test per day);
Stop a hemorrhage (reduces Bleeding by 1 per SL achieved).

When bandages, poultices, or appropriate equipment are used, the GM may consider that the risk of infection is reduced or eliminated.

If you tend to someone affected by a disease, a successful Care Test protects you from that disease for the day.

Some serious injuries require the Surgery Talent to be treated properly. The GM may apply bonuses or penalties depending on the severity of the wound, the quality of available equipment, or the conditions under which care is provided.
